#: src/libvlc-module.c:674
msgid ""
"Language of the audio track you want to use (comma separated, two or three "
"letter ISO-639 country code; you may use 'none' to avoid a fallback to "
"another language)."
msgstr ""
"Cànan an traca fuaime a tha thu airson cleachdadh (air a sgaradh le "
"cromagan, còd dùthcha ISO-639 le dà no trì litrichean; 's urrainn dhut "
"'none' a chleachdadh gus nach tèid cànan eile a chleachdadh 'na àite)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:679
msgid ""
"Language of the subtitle track you want to use (comma separated, two or "
"three letter ISO-639 country code; you may use 'any' as a fallback)."
msgstr ""
"Cànan traca nam fo-thiotalan a tha thu airson cleachdadh (air a sgaradh le "
"cromagan, còd dùthcha ISO-639 le dà no trì litrichean; 's urrainn dhut 'any' "
"a chleachdadh mar roghainn-èiginn)."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:684
msgid ""
"Language of the menus you want to use with DVD/BluRay (comma separated, two "
"or three letter ISO-639 country code; you may use 'any' as a fallback)."
msgstr ""
"Cànan nan clàr-taice a tha thu airson cleachdadh le DVD/BluRay (air a "
"sgaradh le cromagan, còd dùthcha ISO-639 le dà no trì litrichean; 's urrainn "
"dhut 'any' a chleachdadh mar roghainn-èiginn)."

