msgstr ""
"Aisigidh seo staid na cluiche mu dheireadh, can na tracaichean a chaidh a "
"thaghadh, an reat, co-mheas an deilbh, ..."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:821
msgid "Subtitle position"
msgstr "Ionad nam fo-thiotalan"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:823
msgid ""
"How high the subtitles are, in percent of the height of the picture above "
"their usual place (below it when negative). The same on any screen and in "
"any window size."
msgstr ""
"Dè cho àrd 's a bhios na fo-thiotalan, mar cheudad de dh'àirde an deilbh os "
"cionn an àite àbhaisteach aca (fodha ma tha e àicheil). Bidh e co-ionann air "
"sgrìn sam bith 's aig meud uinneige sam bith."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:834
msgid "Display sub-pictures on full window"
msgstr ""

#: src/libvlc-module.c:836
